    pure_table=['','### Все 8 исторических Pure cases (9 последовательных изменений)','', '| Case | Radius / K | Saved | Changed ray-pair cells | Reversed first-creation pairs | Acceptance pose changed |','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---|']
